"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"A senior Hamas official said they agreed to a peace plan. Israel has not said anything about it.\",            \"english_title\": \"Hamas Peace Plan\",            \"translated_version\": \"Un jefe de Hamas dijo que acordaron un plan de paz. Israel no ha dicho nada sobre eso.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Plan de Paz de Hamas\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"At least 15 people drowned trying to swim to Spanish territory. There was chaos at the border.\",            \"english_title\": \"Tragedy at the Border\",            \"translated_version\": \"Al menos 15 personas se ahogaron tratando de nadar a territorio espa\u00f1ol. Hubo caos en la frontera.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Tragedia en la Frontera\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Iran might think it can manage its conflict to pressure the US without starting a full war.\",            \"english_title\": \"Iran's Strategy\",            \"translated_version\": \"Ir\u00e1n podr\u00eda pensar que puede manejar su conflicto para presionar a EE.UU. sin empezar una guerra completa.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Estrategia de Ir\u00e1n\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"A missile made a big crater near a village in Poland, close to Ukraine's border.\",            \"english_title\": \"Missile in Poland\",            \"translated_version\": \"Un misil hizo un gran cr\u00e1ter cerca de un pueblo en Polonia, cerca de la frontera con Ucrania.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Misil en Polonia\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Romania, Bulgaria, and Serbia are dealing with heatwaves and low rainfall.\",            \"english_title\": \"Heatwaves in Europe\",            \"translated_version\": \"Rumania, Bulgaria y Serbia est\u00e1n lidiando con olas de calor y poca lluvia.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Olas de Calor en Europa\"        }    ]}